!docs/pall_modified_hparams.md
!docs/standard_vs_overlap.md
!docs/server_setup.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Binary and generated document formats
#
# Images and PDFs are generated by the tools in tools/.  The thesis figures and
# the compiled thesis itself are the exceptions, allow-listed below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.png
*.pdf
*.xml
!thesis/images/*.png
!thesis/images/*.pdf
!thesis/front/template/images/besmellah.png
!thesis/front/template/images/logo.pdf
!thesis/thesis.pdf

